    <meta name="title" content="Node board batch 12: an articulated desk lamp as a CAD product structure" />
    <meta name="description" content="CADLayer, CADAssembly, CADPart, CADFace and StaticGroup as a CAD tool would write them: a lamp assembly with a base, a two-link arm and a shade hinged at its apex with a bulb in it, each part a CADPart with its own pose (translation, rotation about a hinge center) and named faces, sorted into a Structure layer and a Lighting layer. Every part is placed only by its CADPart fields, so a misread CADPart puts it at the origin. The import must give the parts their poses; the export must write the product structure back." />
